# Sample Ooda CLI Build Invocation

File: ooda/examples/build.oot

## Build a .oo file

```sh
ooda build src/main.oo -o build/main
```

This invokes `cli/build/host_build.oo::run_oodac_build` with rest `["src/main.oo", "-o", "build/main"]`. Requires `OODA_COMPILER`. Default backend is LLVM.

## Run a .oo file

```sh
ooda run src/main.oo
```

This invokes `cli/build/host_build.oo::run_oodac_run`.

## Time a .oo file

`ooda bench` is a moved verb (exit 2). Use `bb bench <file>`.
